  "body": "The `pr` attribute as mentioned in section [4.3](https://www.w3.org/TR/resource-hints/#speculative-resource-prefetching-prefetch) and [4.5](https://www.w3.org/TR/resource-hints/#prerendering-prerender) of the W3C [Resource Hints](https://www.w3.org/TR/resource-hints/) spec is not present in the content attributes list of the `<link>` element (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element). \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/w3c/html/issues/1629",
